{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_aosta_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_aosta_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "編織來日",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_aosta_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7134bbcd6acda47d162879735c68c3add83b24686cdd31e25ea3ea06527642e9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "在這裡！我看到他啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "術師幹員",
      "text": "嗯來了來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "唔，你們好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "已經做好了，看一看符合心意嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "喔喔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "術師幹員",
      "text": "呵，真的是你做的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "我沒想到這麼快就做好了！好、好可愛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "做的時候有了一些靈感，所以時間比想像中用得少，還有想修改的地方嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "我完全沒有意見，這就是我想要的樣子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "喏，這是當時定好的報酬~順便，我們前幾天在廚房烤了些餅乾，也請收下嘗嘗吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "餅乾嗎？唔，謝謝了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我越看越喜歡，你領子內襯用的材料也好好哦！摸上去軟軟的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "對，我試過好幾種材料，還是這種更柔軟一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "那幾天為了挑材料真是費了不少事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "那你是在宿舍裡做這衣服的嗎，需要的材料會很多吧？我前陣子沉迷積木的時候也是，不知不覺佔用了太多公共空間，已經被罵了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "你的舍友會對這個有意見嗎？要是因為我你們之間有了矛盾，我會有點過意不去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "那倒沒有，他們都知道我這個愛好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "不過，柏喙幹員申請了一個紡織室，你也可以去和後勤部申請一下，這樣材料就不用堆在宿舍裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "或者你可以在艦上開個攤的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "text": "柏喙小姐基本上只主動去找人做衣服，梓蘭小姐基本上是提供一些穿搭經驗，你要是開個小攤，就是獨一份呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "術師幹員",
      "text": "不過看你的表情，你是不是還沒和她們說過話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "嗯......是的。說實在的，你們都是聽了賈維的話才來找我的，但我其實還沒想過要給其他幹員做衣服掛件這些事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我也還不認識你說的這兩位幹員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "術師幹員",
      "text": "我就這麼一提啦~不過柏喙和梓蘭小姐她們都是很好相處的人，你要是想和她們聊聊，肯定不會有問題的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "術師幹員",
      "text": "那位就是柏喙小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "叫我嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "啊、啊，不好意思！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "這裡就是我的倉庫了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "今天我還邀請了梓蘭姐，她會來給其他幹員們教教設計，你要是有什麼知道的縫紉知識，也可以教給大家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "打擾了，只是我原本是打算來問點問題，可能沒什麼能教的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "沒事沒事，我其實也沒什麼能教給大家的東西，只是互相交流一下自己關於縫紉的想法，你能來，我很感謝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "柏喙？我來啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "梓蘭姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "這位是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "您好，我是奧斯塔，今天也一起來上課。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "“您”？不用這麼禮貌啦。你比我組裡的人看起來順眼多了，和他們待久了，有點不敢相信羅德島上還有這樣的好孩子......啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "真好，我還以為只有我一個男幹員呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "抱歉，我是最後一個來的嗎？給大家帶了一點小吃，閒置時間可以嘗一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "謝謝梓蘭姐，那我們開始吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "整個倉庫逐漸充滿了小聲但熱烈的討論，所有人都沉浸在縫紉的世界裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "（呃，現在就去問肯定不太好。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "（他們看起來都互相認識，我要不要過去融入一下話題？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "（柏喙幹員和梓蘭幹員......源石結晶......啊。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "（她們二位也得了礦石病啊......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "（看上去都好開心，是因為找到了自己喜歡做的事嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "（這個倉庫......裡面放滿了柏喙幹員的材料啊，怪不得那個幹員也建議我申請一下。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "打擾了，請問你知道這種毛線包怎麼編嗎？我想當禮物送給一個人，但是自己試了好久都不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "她們都在忙，我想來問一下你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "柏喙和梓蘭已經全身心地投入到討論中去，無暇分心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......哦，好的，讓我來看一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "是圖片上這種樣式的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我明白了......這種編法有些複雜，如果有那種固定編織的工作臺......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "是這種嗎？在這裡有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "對，我先試驗一下，看我想的是不是正確的，你稍等一會兒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "嗯，謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......你說用這種毛線會不會光澤度更好一點？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "唔，燈照上去確實會比原來這條看上去溫潤一些，她應該會喜歡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......還有這種，在毛線裡穿上這些碎粒，會增加一些......說不出來，但更加精緻了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "我看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "哇哦，你叫奧斯塔對嗎，你接不接單？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "嗯？啊，接的，你有什麼需求——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "等下，你的袖子這裡破了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "桌子上這根釘子支出來了，是不是剛才掛在上面扯壞了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "不要緊，縫一下就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "那個，請問針在哪裡......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "在你背後，櫃子抽屜拉開——第三層？或者第四層！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "你還需要線嗎？我還帶來了點別的材料，在那個箱子裡，你都可以隨便用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "謝謝，我只用一下針線就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "嗯？我以為你是在縫東西，原來你是在補自己的衣服？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "哎呀，這個針腳，是不是衣服穿在身上你不太方便補？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "奧斯塔幹員，要不然你先把外套脫了，我們這裡也不缺材料，你放在桌上好好補一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "趕緊過來，你這個口子太不雅觀了，我給你縫上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "線呢？這裡還剩一卷......這是白的還是黑的？好髒，你是帶著它在泥裡開派對了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "嗯......花的？看不出來，你管他呢，能用就行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "別忘了，做完這個活，我們回去後還要去買布料，做點新的衣服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "對，去年的教訓一定要記住，便宜的不能要，原料太差了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "誰知道它用的是劣質染料啊，那疹子可真夠疼的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "下回穿之前多洗幾次吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "啊，我以前都是這樣補的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "因為這種布料很耐磨，隨手補一下，又能繼續穿很久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "可是你剛才給我編那個毛線包的時候，用的都是好東西啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "那是因為在幫你做東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "別人的委託自然要好好做完，我的衣服當時設計的時候選用的就是耐磨的材料，用粗線針距大一點更不會被磨破，實用性上——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "嘶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "看來是釘子把你的胳膊也劃破了，剛才一直都沒覺得疼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "沒事，破了一點點，也不流血了，我抹一下就行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "被劃破了嗎？等下，我這裡......果然有！隨身帶的創可貼，備了好幾個呢，因為不知道什麼時候在哪裡就能用到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "把胳膊伸出來。我自己還備了個小醫療箱，就害怕誰哪天磕碰了，可以救個急......我怎麼這麼熟練？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "算了，過來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "其實不用——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "好好消毒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "噗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "就算傷口只有一點點，被釘子劃破了也是要消毒的，萬一上面有鏽之類的東西，感染了可是大問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "......哦哦？你這個表情我好像在誰臉上看到過，你是不是想說這點小傷不算什麼之類的話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "以前不管怎麼樣都是以前，現在你在羅德島上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "有條件了當然就要把條件運用到最好，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "嗯......貼好了，謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我繼續做吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "剩下的我來吧？我在旁邊已經看得差不多了，而且本來就是我要送給別人的禮物，你衣服和胳膊都破了，我還拜託你繼續做，說不過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "不過真的很謝謝你！幫了我這麼大一個忙，下次你出任務我也跟著，結束後我給你買件新的外套！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我從小都想這麼幹，等我有能力自己賺錢，一定要買什麼禮物好好感謝身邊幫了我的人，你這個兄弟我交上了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我今天一直在想一個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "說說看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "你們小時候有沒有想過長大了以後要成為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "還有這種事？我想的是什麼......成為家族老大？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "......沒想過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我之前......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "在拿起武器之前，在父親讓我跟隨他之前......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我想成為一名公務員，過那種安穩的生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "下針可以再大膽點，不用擔心會把布料扎壞，剛開始都是這樣的，留下針眼了還有別的方法嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "有想法就要去嘗試，不要因為害怕會做壞就不做啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "想遮住身上的源石啊，放心，這樣一搭配就什麼都看不出來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "不過我最近也在想，我為什麼要把它一直藏著呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我也這樣想過......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "還是我來把它編完吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "（啊，本來還想跟她們聊聊的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "（......現在看來，不去聊也沒什麼問題了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "（我好像一直沒能想清楚這件事情。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "奧斯塔......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "唔，不好意思，走了一下神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "等我把這個毛線包編完，你們可以幫我一起來選一下做外套的布料嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我想聽一下你們的意見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "好呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "終於開竅了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "認真的幹員",
      "text": "我也一起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "謝謝你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "或許這個就是他想要的生活方式，或許自己可以嘗試去抓住它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......這些布料......剛才他們幾個硬塞給我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "要做點什麼好好謝謝他們才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "還有剛才柏喙說的......她想讓我也多一點嘗試，她自己走出來了以後覺得走出來很好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "呀呼——！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "呵？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "嘿嘿！猜猜我剛才幹了什麼！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "沒興趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "小爺我剛才可是——技壓群雄！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "哎，別走呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "看看這是什麼？是誰獲得了冠軍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "是小爺！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "羅德島第一屆嘴裡塞小圓餅大賽，二十六個！誰還能強過小爺我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "居然有人和你一起瘋，食堂阿姨也沒打死你？真是命大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "嘿嘿，那我都吃下去了，又不是浪費。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "布洛卡呢？他又去哪了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我可要好好說給他聽聽，跟你說一點勁都沒有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "跟我說沒勁？那你可要好好跟他吹噓一下，最好明天我能在《羅德島每日新聞報》上看到你勇奪第一的超大頭條。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "那小爺我可要——我們還有新聞報這東西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "你可以是個起點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "別以為我聽不出來你在損我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "不說了，剛才那個是不是布洛卡？我走囉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，冠軍！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，看我！我在這裡畫了幅畫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "這是什麼東西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "......哇哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "看不出來嗎？小爺我痛擊家族手下的英勇場景！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "哎，笑一下嘛！至於嗎？不就是又被追著打，咱們這樣的次數還少嗎？等他們追來了再跑不就行了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "車都在這裡，想那麼多幹什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "這裡真的是安全得......不像樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "奧斯塔手裡仍舊是那幾卷布料樣品，它們沉重但柔軟，很溫暖。\n他看著賈維跑遠的身影，飛起來的頭髮絲裡都寫滿了開心，不再是以前苦中作樂的樣子。\n奧斯塔邁開步伐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "博士，今天是我做助理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "需要我做什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "暫時還沒有，你可以先在旁邊坐坐。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
          "text": "好的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
          "text": "博士，我能在艦內開一家DIY室嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
